l uses the selected handler’s level. Changes apply to existing sessions,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"though logs already in progress may use the previous settings.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"YubiKit’s configuration does not affect other libraries. To share your app’s backend,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pass its factory explicitly; global ","type":"text"},{"code":"LoggingSystem.bootstrap","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" does not select YubiKit’s backend.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Factories may run concurrently and must not log through YubiKit themselves.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Traffic-logging","text":"Traffic logging","level":3},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["Logging.configure(logLevel: .trace)"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Raw traffic and SCP plaintext logs require ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"YubiKit to be compiled with ","type":"text"},{"code":"DEBUG","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Neither configuration nor a custom backend can enable them in other builds.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Custom connections are responsible for their own traffic logging.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Debug logs can include account names and credential identifiers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Trace logs can include PINs, credentials, and cryptographic keys. Protect or redact logs before sharing them."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"warning","name":"Warning"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Custom-backends","text":"Custom backends","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Labels identify categories, such as ","type":"text"},{"code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.OATH","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.FIDO","ty